SUMMARY:Montclair's Pumpkin Patch
DESCRIPTION:Come to St. Luke’s for the Most Sincere Pumpkin Patch around! Our pumpkin labyrinth will be open through October 31. All are welcome to visit for prayer\, play\, and photos. \nPumpkins are available to purchase from 10am – 7pm. Our pricing for your suggested donation supports the Navajo Nation members who cultivate\, harvest\, and ship our pumpkins\, as well as our Youth programs. You may pay via Zelle\, Venmo\, text or cash. More information is on display at the Pumpkin Patch\, or email info@slechurch.org. \nLearn more about St. Luke’s at slechurch.org. \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
URL:https://montclairlocal.news/event/montclairs-pumpkin-patch-2/2026-10-10/
