SUMMARY:Fall Fun at Camp Liberty – A Day of Literacy and Art Activities
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a FREE Fall Fun Day at Camp Liberty on October 10\, 2026. We have a full day of Literacy and Art Activities scheduled! A Whimsy Kids’ Tea Party at 10AM for ages 6-12. At 1PM we take a trip back in time with Austen At The Pavilion\, and an Evening With Edgar Allan Poe at 6PM for teens and adults 16 and up. Please see flyer for more details. \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
