SUMMARY:Nature Explorers at Van Vleck Gardens
DESCRIPTION:Nature Explorers \nSaturdays\, 10:30AM -12:30PM\nSeptember 12\nOctober 10\nDecember 19\nOur new family program\, Nature Explorers\, is a free program offered on select Saturdays. Each session will be host to a different garden or nature inspired activity such as\, “adopting” a tree\, creating and adding to a community art project\, seasonal scavenger hunts\, finding art in nature\, bird watching\, and more! Programming is designed for ages 5 and up\, but all are welcome!\nPlease Note: This is a drop-in program but not a drop-off program. Parents/caregivers need to stay with their child/children\, as activities are self-guided.\nThe event is FREE but pre-registration is encouraged. \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
