SUMMARY:Adelphi Orchestra Opens 73rd Season: American Voice at 250
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate America’s 250th anniversary as the Adelphi Orchestra opens its 73rd season under Principal Conductor Kyunghun Kim\, featuring guest violinist Sophia Werner in Barber’s Violin Concerto and Beethoven’s Symphony No. 8. \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
